<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FAQ – SHINEX Learning Circle</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header', { showBack: true }) %>

    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
            <h2 style="font-size:2rem; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 4px;">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:24px;">Find quick answers to common questions about SHINEX Learning Circle.</p>

            <div class="card" style="padding:20px 24px;">

                <!-- FAQ 1 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>What is SHINEX Learning Circle?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        SHINEX Learning Circle (SLC) is a Nigerian-based online learning platform offering practical courses in technology, design, and business. We provide hands-on training to help you build real-world skills.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 2 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How do I register?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Click the <strong>Register</strong> button at the top right of the page, fill in your personal, contact, academic information, choose your course, and set a password. You'll receive a verification email with your unique Student ID.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 3 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>What is my Student ID and how do I use it?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Your Student ID is a unique identifier in the format <strong>SLC-2026-XX-XXX</strong>. It is automatically generated during registration. You can use it to log in to your account instead of your email address.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 4 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>What courses do you offer?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        We offer 10 courses: Cybersecurity, Data Analysis, Digital Marketing, Graphic Design, Motion Design, Networking, Programming, UI/UX Design, Web Development, and WordPress Development. More courses will be added in the future.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 5 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Is it free to learn?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Yes, currently all courses are completely free. We believe in making quality education accessible to everyone. In the future, we may introduce premium features, but core learning will remain free.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 6 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How do I track my progress?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Your <strong>Dashboard</strong> shows your overall progress, completed classes, and points earned. Inside each level, you'll see a progress bar and class completion status. Complete a class to earn +10 points.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 7 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>What if I forget my Student ID or password?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        You can log in using your <strong>email address</strong> instead. If you've forgotten your password, contact support at <strong>support@shinex.ng</strong> for assistance. We are working on a password reset feature.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 8 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Can I change my course after registration?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Yes! Go to your <strong>Dashboard</strong> and click the <strong>Change Course</strong> button. You'll be able to select a new course. Your progress will reset for the new course.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 9 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How do I contact support?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Visit the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> to send us a message. You can also email us at <strong>support@shinex.ng</strong> or call <strong>+234 800 SHINEX</strong> during business hours (Mon-Fri, 9AM-6PM WAT).
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 10 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Do I get a certificate after completing a course?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Not yet, but we are working on introducing certificates of completion. Stay tuned for updates. In the meantime, focus on building your skills and completing all levels.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 11 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How does the AI Tutor work?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        The AI Tutor is a floating chat button on every page. You can ask it questions about your courses, technology, or careers. It uses the Groq AI API to provide educational and helpful responses in real time.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- FAQ 12 -->
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Is my data safe?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Yes. We take data security seriously. All passwords are hashed using bcrypt, and we follow best practices to protect your personal information. Read our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for more details.
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Still have questions? -->
            <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:24px; padding:20px; background:var(--primary-bg); border-radius:14px;">
                <h4 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 4px;">📧 Still have questions?</h4>
                <p style="color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:12px;">We're here to help. Reach out to us anytime.</p>
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Contact Support
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>